    memoryGibPerVcpu : AutoscalingAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1AutoscalingGroupSpecForProviderMixedInstancesPolicyLaunchTemplateOverrideItems0InstanceRequirementsMemoryGibPerVcpu, default is Undefined, optional
